  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "202dbe9ee4a837ee2ca474fe7bc33cf46cf3100d4f9daf577a7b3d155c835a0c",
      "text": "甲. 依《社会福利事业法》第十一条第一款取得二级以上社会福利师"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00032",
      "source_hash": "9f52072ce0beb5fbf352f40913675a36e57f485884e5ae8beac54f47eea98cce",
      "text": "资格，并从事社会福利或者人权领域相关工作"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "e8c98273e29bbd1efc321aec907ff5c146af89431b9146f8a5c64e8306f63764",
      "text": "满三年以上的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "325091d6fe78366bdf39a7bcd1786143e3def9ff1e027badb67717d01fc9b623",
      "text": "乙. 在社会福利设施、社会福利团体或者人权团体担任管理人员或职员，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00035",
      "source_hash": "15adac939c72b3d3c63e5b3440c501aed8a0c24b4c234a32b2ff63dffbff96bd",
      "text": "从事社会福利或者人权领域相关工作满三年"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "fc6b864d8e01ba8e79c3465b80dc479349f49e2227e9ede2c658ed162e4af6d3",
      "text": "的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00037",
      "source_hash": "87ef78f2d28b5e0c8386481eccbc2d123e601bc1a41ef492f9afc5b30545846b",
      "text": "丙. 作为国家或者地方自治团体的公务员，在社会福利或者人权"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "844f210b88a93623a4ff5fe90ae9e83300195f7227e1bba732568426b5f2a9a8",
      "text": "领域相关工作满三年的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "ef6a975cb761b5a014b49f5fba7a10bf0435a59682e11cd088ccd9c3b59be002",
      "text": "丁. 在《高等教育法》第二条规定的学校，取得法学、社会学、社会福利学、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "04afaa4d7124299df6111154cf523d450cd3d5ad628e81a39231af1047a9ad08",
      "text": "女性学或者其他类似领域的学士学位或者"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "28d0e23c4d5c873b937f31d40da4ed37b419e4da6264a73f6b6aa3aebf4ae814",
      "text": "专科学士学位的人（包括依法被认定具有同等学历的人），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "3b3b9f836428b43a7b9ece96479da3e2c4efd69752203824ad8c0d85688d3f14",
      "text": "从事社会福利或者"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "47c862b90e562c920ca8d97dab464f2ea28737b5a75b8336de85193d6e727cf2",
      "text": "人权领域相关工作满三年的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00045",
      "source_hash": "f70b2aa99749d4d3a7ae843d55e3969874fc259c7e226bf539baa9dcc3256124",
      "text": "甲. 在《高等教育法》第二条规定的学校取得学士学位或者"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00046",
      "source_hash": "0ce8c6577943dc81f32eadcf37f2729fadee2fc2762ba85c429963ac49991195",
      "text": "专科学士学位的人（包括依法被认定具有同等学历的人），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "e63dfc458d4ad1d107191501a42c983844e218a3fac4355bc1454cad740e5843",
      "text": "从事社会福利或者"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00048",
      "source_hash": "24dee0355f5d9b106e27c77c41bd9bb244990d159ab24f031811ca0fc4a72fdb",
      "text": "人权领域相关工作满一年的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00049",
      "source_hash": "57cc92f76b976b20080b601b51da0fcdc0b6b85ee507c221120362c5374134ee",
      "text": "乙. 在社会福利设施、社会福利团体、公益团体或者人权团体担任职员，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00050",
      "source_hash": "aa5f3bcc3640b44a8db8c543e6cb6921242824c2e36a2063fffea2feec4c845a",
      "text": "从事社会福利或者人权领域相关工作满两年"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00051",
      "source_hash": "308649aa27ebeeb22a2dd5629246060668f4aa6d6da3c83127426d42fef94710",
      "text": "的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00052",
      "source_hash": "8a9e41843b01fcdf20bada2d8c16f4f9cfabd5d5b68d36853c4d11035070eecd",
      "text": "备注：本表所称“工作经验”，包括取得相应资格或学位之前、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39475-zh-00053",
      "source_hash": "026e39ce30599ef0d826585daf2c1f0bbdc2db1e89d8d0b7f0f54be823d28e5a",
      "text": "被有关机构聘用为管理人员或职员之前，或者被任命为公务员之前的工作经历。"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Compared 24 XML fragments from Korean Annex 2 role qualification table: team leader grade-two social welfare qualification and three-year experience, public officers and bachelor/associate routes; team member one- and two-year routes; prior work experience is included. Removed END marker. Rows 30,44 unchanged."
